WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.897 --> 00:00:08.117
Two quick jobs you'll do often. Helping a student who forgot their P-I-N, and inviting a parent to follow along.

2
00:00:08.619 --> 00:00:16.949
On the Students tab, find the student, and select Reset P-I-N. Type a new one, four to six digits, and save.

3
00:00:17.451 --> 00:00:24.201
Tell the student, and ask them to keep it somewhere private. The old P-I-N stops working straight away.

4
00:00:24.702 --> 00:00:36.562
A tip. Five wrong tries in a row will lock a username for about fifteen minutes. If a student says they're locked out, give it a little time, or reset the P-I-N to a fresh one.

5
00:00:37.064 --> 00:00:45.134
To invite a parent, select Invite Parent on that student's row. Enter the parent's email, and add a short message if you'd like.

6
00:00:45.636 --> 00:00:50.136
Select Send Invite. The invitation works for fourteen days.

7
00:00:50.637 --> 00:01:04.287
Pending invitations are listed below the students. If you sent one to the wrong address, select Revoke, and confirm. The link in the parent's email stops working. If an invitation expires, send a new one.

8
00:01:04.791 --> 00:01:12.391
Parents only see whether each lesson is done, and the lesson resources. They don't see quiz answers or what their child wrote.
